+| ASSEMBLY.v1: macro weights m! product C/ell! and uniform interleaving | provisional | disjoint supports; connected primitives | Sep 5 R3 eq.(1)-(4) | coordinator intake | FIBER, COUNT | reprove per-word cancellation |
