@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# Regression registry
+
+| ID | fixture / previous failure | expected outcome | affected claims |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| BOUND | N=1/2; m=0, odd m,m=2; connected minimal and genus-one lengths | classify feasibility exactly; no division by zero | all |
