+| r1_recursive | complete positive-moment final-transposition sampler, R1-T1.1 | frozen; R2 and R3 nonauthor reviews active |
+| r2_structural | complete unicyclic cut sampler with reciprocal mark rejection, C1 | frozen; R1 nonauthor parser/multiplicity review active |
