+| coordinator | canonical integration, independent C/Z checks, exact global certificates, asymptotic restricted-method obstruction | global mathematical audit accepted; final synthesis pending |
+
+The blind referee received only the separate brief and operational/safety
+instructions in fork_turns=none. It saved blind_report.md at
