+
+Final delivery check, 22:11 UTC: I read R2's complete synthesis_audit.md,
+accepted both minor metadata corrections, and reconciled the exact reviewed
+versions. The canonical mathematical body is byte-identical to frozen R1,
+the sample AST is unchanged except its introductory docstring, and all
+saved mathematical fields match across the three decisive reruns. The
